                    <h2 class="cmp-tile-fact__heading">
                      <span class="cmp-tile-fact__heading-text">
                          All staff have a role in managing risk
                      </span>
                    </h2>
                
                <div class="cmp-tile-fact__description">
                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-3a55fdef88" class="cmp-text">
    <p><span class="p3"><span class="p2">All staff throughout Macquarie are expected to manage risks in accordance with the risk management framework and foster an appropriate and effective risk culture.<br />
 </span></span></p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
